{"toolCallId":"call_fe4556aa96a54070b85b44aa42390059","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"?? specs/zz-bench-authoring/\n---\nspecs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/spec.md:89:| REQ-008 | When `--json` and `--min-percent <N>` are passed together, the JSON output gains a boolean field `min_percent_met`, `true` when `Overall Completion` is at or above `N` and `false` otherwise | `--json --min-percent P` on a folder reporting `P` prints `\"min_percent_met\": true`; `--json --min-percent $((P+1))` prints `\"min_percent_met\": false` |\nspecs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/tasks.md:49:- [ ] T014 Add a `min_percent_met` boolean to the folder-mode JSON object, `true` when `OVERALL_PERCENTAGE` is at or above `MIN_PERCENT` and `false` otherwise, emitted only when both `--json` and `--min-percent` are passed (REQ-008) (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/calculate-completeness.sh`)\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/wa3f8a76d29/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"19561b","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
